    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Forf">Forf.</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">… æt ælcon ðeofstolenan orfe 7 be his . . . forfange sylle, þæt is æt ælcon scill' penig, sy ðæs cynnes orf ðe hit sy, gyf hit man æt ðeofes handa ahret.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">.. for all stolen property and by its … [reward for] recovery was at [the ratio of] one penny per shilling, whatever kind of property it was, as long as it was recovered from thieves.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Sed antiquum rectum est, ut se omni fortiuo pecore secundum precium estimatum forfang reddatur, id est de uno quoque sol. unus denarius, sit eiusmodi pecus quod sit, si a (de) latronum manibus excuciatur.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
